          "benefits_md": "> **Pattern of Assistance:**\n\nSupply of Bio-pesticides/Bio-agents and equipment at 50% subsidy.\n> **Type of Assistance:**\n\n1. Free distribution of Bio-pesticides/Bio-agents.\n2. 50% subsidy sale on Plant protection equipment.\n",
          "briefDescription": "The objective of the scheme is to control pests and diseases including weeds and rodents of horticultural crops by the distribution of bio-pesticides/Bio-agents and equipment at 50% subsidy.",
